Comment:
The quality, variety & presentation of the meals were extremely poor & disappointing! THe meal choices/options were most limited;
ordered items often exchanged or not delivered; & menus unappealing. Better emphasis on nutritional needs is needed. Also, the
"pantry" facility for supplementing meals very inadequate.
